    # Light Crafting
    

    For some recipes you're able to use an item on the object in order to craft something without a blueprint!
    See the table below.

    ## Details
    - Once a modification is done, it cannot be reversed or removed
    - Some recipes require you to hold both in your hand and click on the item with the armor in order to prevent it 
    from going into the storage.

